#ASSERT `How much can I be charged for a bill` `as the client` EQUALS amount 0
#ASSERT `Must I be given a costs report` `as the client` `an individual` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Must I be given a costs report` `as the client` `an individual` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS yes
