#ASSERT `Can my law practice sue me now` `as the client` `a lump sum bill` TRUE (Date 1 5 2029) FALSE (Date 1 5 2029) TRUE FALSE FALSE (Date 1 9 2029) EQUALS `on suing` `no: the costs dispute before the Board has not been closed or resolved (s 194(2)(a))`
#ASSERT `Can my law practice sue me now` `as the client` `a lump sum bill` TRUE (Date 1 5 2029) FALSE (Date 1 5 2029) FALSE FALSE FALSE (Date 30 5 2029) EQUALS `on suing` `not yet: 30 days have not passed since the bill, or the itemised bill (s 194(2)(b))`
