#ASSERT `Can I have my law practice's costs assessed` `as the client` `an individual` (Date 15 3 2029) (Date 1 4 2029) TRUE FALSE EQUALS `on assessment` `not yet: the costs are in a costs dispute the Board has not referred to assessment (s 197)`
